  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1333/767/638867038797861305.gif\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使用本模组，您可以在任何地方做出表情动作动画。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">默认情况下，这些动画未绑定任何按键，因此您需要手动设置。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">这样做是为了让您只在按键绑定设置中为想要使用的动画分配按键。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">按下按键后，动画仅执行一次。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">行走时可以播放表情动作，但部分动作在潜行时会被取消。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">这取决于该动画使用的是身体的哪个部位。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">例如，欢呼与大笑的动画在潜行时会被取消。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">且同一时间只能使用一个动画。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">支持多人游戏。（服务器也需要安装本模组！）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模组当前支持：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.1.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.2 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.1.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>NeoForge 26.1.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果您需要其他版本的模组，或在 CurseForge 上遇到任何 Bug，请给我发送私信。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上关注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>安装本模组前需要先安装 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
